T1  Parse the PRD slices
Wave 1  depends on none

Problem
A PRD arrives as markdown. The factory needs its title,     
intro and slices before it can draft tickets.               

Acceptance criteria
AC-1  a PRD with a title and two slices parses into two
      slices
AC-2  a PRD with no slices is refused with a message that
      names the missing section

